.DS_Store

# Keep the committed lockfile even under a parent .gitignore that ignores lockfiles
# (for example a pnpm monorepo). Installs need this frozen tree: without it, npm
# re-resolves caret ranges against the live registry on every install, and the
# runtime image's npm 10.9.x can crash building the peer set from scratch
# ("Cannot read properties of null (reading 'edgesOut')").
!package-lock.json
